### GET Profile

GET {{base_url}}/users/profile/me/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### PATCH User Profile Profile

PATCH {{base_url}}/users/profile/me/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "full_name": "Test User",
  "phone_number": "2349234",
  "job_title": "Graphic designer"
}



### GET Business Profile

GET {{base_url}}/users/business-profile/me/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### PUT Business Profile

PUT {{base_url}}/users/business-profile/me/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "address": "Kodassery House, PO Madavana, Kodungallur, Eriyad, Thrissur, 680666",
  "business_name": "UIkart",
  "currency": "INR",
  "gst_number": "",
  "business_email": "uikart@email.com",
  "phone_number": "+919746469319",
  "vat_number": ""
}


### PATCH Business Profile

PATCH {{base_url}}/users/business-profile/me/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "website":"noufal.me"
}


